[334,0,0,1867,"Julia Jackson with Loose Hair","In 1867 Cameron photographed her niece with her hair loose around her shoulders. Women in Victorian times usually wore their hair up, so this was a bold, artistic choice.","Why do you think the hair is loose?"],
